  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Kailh Choc V2 (PG1353) low profile mechanical keyboard switch, through-hole soldering, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.3=13.95mm square (Kailh Choc V2). Keycap: 2.00u (courtyard 38.05x19.00mm). Kailh Choc V2 stabilizer (CPG1353G24D01): PCB cutout slots (Edge.Cuts) and plate cuts on User.5 (overlapping outlines; union in plate CAD). Plate required. For Choc V2 / Gateron KS-33 only (not Choc V1).")
